 "script": {
  "hook": "Every popcorn kernel is a tiny pressure cooker, and some of them fail.",
  "beats": [
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "text": "Inside each kernel, a strong outer hull seals in a small amount of moisture."
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "text": "That same tough hull also encases the starch packed within."
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "text": "As the kernel heats, the trapped water turns into vapor."
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "text": "Sealed inside, that vapor builds pressure against the hull."
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "text": "Eventually the hull ruptures, and the hot starch expands rapidly outward."
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "text": "In an instant, that burst transforms a hard seed into a fluffy snack."
   },
   {
    "id": "b7",
    "text": "But kernels with cracks or weak spots can leak moisture while they heat, so pressure never builds and they stay unpopped."
   }
  ],
  "outro": "So a leaky hull can explain that stubborn kernel at the bottom of the bowl.",
  "claims": [
   {
    "text": "A popcorn kernel heats trapped water that builds pressure until it pops.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.9
   },
   {
    "text": "A strong hull holds moisture inside a popcorn kernel.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.95
   },
   {
    "text": "The hull surrounds starch inside the kernel.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.9
   },
   {
    "text": "Heating the water inside the kernel creates vapor.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.95
   },
   {
    "text": "The vapor builds pressure inside the hull.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.95
   },
   {
    "text": "When the hull ruptures, hot starch expands rapidly.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.95
   },
   {
    "text": "The expanding starch forms the fluffy snack.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.95
   },
   {
    "text": "Cracks or weak spots can release moisture during heating, preventing some kernels from popping.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.95
   },
   {
    "text": "Unpopped kernels can result from hulls that leak moisture.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://ag.purdue.edu/news/2020/02/whats-under-the-shell-of-this-popular-snack.html",
    "confidence": 0.9
   }
  ]
 },
